{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（4日）早上10時59分，警方接報指，旺角彌敦道673號滙豐銀行內，有兩名中國籍男子出示一張銀行本票，金額寫上1,000萬元。銀行職員懷疑為假文件，報警求助。人員到場帶走該兩名男子到警署作進一步調查，案件列「行使虛假文書」跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方帶走2名男子。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172521261339774976960742.jpeg/_nwmwpIQN9gcyjAw9bwLDXe-j0F_z2E_pgJ79owCe_Y\"/><figcaption>警方帶走2名男子。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"旺角彌敦道673號滙豐銀行內，有兩名中國籍男子出示一張銀行本票，金額寫上1,000萬元。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172521263848099840938725.jpeg/NuYQ1vAbFueZuDN1frhUdj1juAvgpOZNyjavQuA2r0I\"/><figcaption>旺角彌敦道673號滙豐銀行內，有兩名中國籍男子出示一張銀行本票，金額寫上1,000萬元。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場帶走兩名男子。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172522004008669184397451.jpeg/a4gFcKnz4KUF-rIm-zA0lER8JaxBQgfeE3GexDlxnsQ\"/><figcaption>警方到場帶走兩名男子。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172521998245433344250963.jpeg/2IRcMYw9Prsu0KWD-2K2eZstckn0zuUGe_4Wh1H-Foc\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為旺角彌敦道673號滙豐大廈。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172522001248686080192836.jpeg/lhyvTY4YJjkG7k8qznt1M2caU5xe9kGivA0tDJYNLQw\"/><figcaption>現場為旺角彌敦道673號滙豐大廈。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為旺角彌敦道673號滙豐大廈。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172513788876820480830617.jpeg/zccjJqBE74hM_xIIuJ8pp8Cz84xL6RVEo5sKSombCko\"/><figcaption>現場為旺角彌敦道673號滙豐大廈。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T05:40:13.455203+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":263,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}